# --- Brand fonts ---
# Fetched at build time by the `fetchBrandFonts` Gradle task (see
# docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md § Typography). They are deliberately not committed so
# the repo stays free of binaries; the app degrades gracefully without them.
# If you prefer reproducible offline builds, delete these two lines and commit
# the .ttf files together with their OFL.txt licence.
core/design/src/main/assets/fonts/*.ttf
core/design/src/main/assets/fonts/OFL-*.txt
